		{"id":"d55af59fddf0e749","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\n\nsequenceDiagram\n\nparticipant Client\n\nparticipant API\n\nparticipant MetadataService\n\nparticipant MinioService\n\nparticipant Extractor\n\nparticipant Agent\n\nparticipant Database\n\n%% Phase 1: Request Reception and Validation\n\nClient->>API: POST /extract-metadata\n\nAPI->>MetadataService: process_metadata_extraction()\n\nMetadataService->>MinioService: object_exists()\n\nMinioService-->>MetadataService: existence check\n\n%% Phase 2: Content Retrieval and Extraction\n\nMetadataService->>MinioService: get_object()\n\nMinioService-->>MetadataService: file_content, metadata\n\nMetadataService->>Extractor: extract()\n\n%% Phase 3: Storage and Response\n\nExtractor->>Extractor: Process file content\n\nExtractor-->>MetadataService: extracted_data\n\nMetadataService->>Database: Store entities/aspects\n\nDatabase-->>MetadataService: confirmation\n\nMetadataService-->>API: result\n\nAPI-->>Client: Success response\n\n```","x":-853,"y":-441,"width":1706,"height":882},
		{"id":"54c7adef5713036e","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\n\ngraph LR\n\nA[Client Request] --> B[FastAPI Router]\n\nB --> C[MetadataService]\n\nC --> D[MinioService]\n\nD --> E[(MinIO Storage)]\n\nC --> F{Extractor Type}\n\nF -->|DDL| G[DDLExtractor]\n\nF -->|Video| H[VideoExtractor]\n\nF -->|Image| I[ImageExtractor]\n\nG --> J[PKFKInferenceAgent]\n\nG --> K[EmbeddingAgent]\n\nC --> L[EntityModel]\n\nC --> M[AspectModel]\n\nC --> N[RelationshipModel]\n\nL --> O[(MongoDB)]\n\nM --> O\n\nN --> O\n\nsubgraph \"AI Agents\"\n\nJ\n\nK\n\nend\n\nsubgraph \"Database Layer\"\n\nL\n\nM\n\nN\n\nend\n\n```","x":960,"y":-441,"width":1580,"height":882}
